; numbers skeleton, normalisation, oracle, and reuse, and writes a .t27
; buffer. Refusals are reported. Golden means the recorded oracle vectors
; and translated tests, not all inputs. ledger.t27 says tri t27o --check
; runs t27b test first and t27c test-report only when t27b's run is not a
; verdict. Issue 10543 does not say that; it specifies tri t27o-sweep.
; This pass did not run t27o. No t27o --emit-ir flag was found in those files.
; LINEUP.md on master is the TRI-NET product page and does not describe t27o.
